*	        text=auto
*.sh		text eol=lf
# Generated reference and its registry snapshots: the generators write LF,
# and a CRLF checkout (Windows) would read every page as drifted.
docs/content/docs/cua-driver/reference/** text eol=lf
scripts/docs-generators/cli-specs/** text eol=lf
scripts/docs-generators/headers/** text eol=lf
# The elastic solver's golden decisions are compared byte for byte with what
# serde writes (LF); a CRLF checkout (Windows) would fail every scenario.
libs/cua/crates/cua-cluster/testdata/elastic/** text eol=lf
# The help snapshots and 0.7.0 upgrade fixtures are compared byte for byte with LF output; a CRLF checkout (Windows) would fail them.
libs/cua/crates/cua-cli/tests/fixtures/** text eol=lf
libs/cua/crates/cua-spaces-ext/tests/fixtures/** text eol=lf
# The bundled agent skills are embedded in cua-agent-setup and installed as they are, and their tree hash
# marks a copy cua wrote; a CRLF checkout (Windows) would ship different bytes and fail the front matter checks.
libs/cua/skills/** text eol=lf
apps/cua-spaces-macos/Sources/CuaSpacesMacKit/Resources/azure-logo_azure.svg -text
apps/cua-spaces-web/public/cloud-logos/azure-logo_azure.svg -text
